      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Every design task is brand (design IS the product) or product (design SERVES the product). Determines which reference file to load. First match: task cue, then surface, then PRODUCT.md register field."
    },
    {
      "id": "impeccable_color_strategy",
      "label": "Color Strategy Axis (Restrained/Committed/Full/Drenched)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": ".agents/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md",
      "source_location": "### Color",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Four commitment levels: Restrained (≤10% accent), Committed (30-60%), Full palette (3-4 roles), Drenched (surface IS the color). Use OKLCH. The 10% rule applies only to Restrained."
    },
    {
      "id": "impeccable_ai_slop_test",
      "label": "AI Slop Test",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": ".agents/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md",
      "source_location": "### The AI slop test",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Two-altitude check: first-order (can you guess theme from category?) and second-order (can you guess aesthetic family from category+anti-references?). Both must fail before the design passes."
    },
    {
      "id": "impeccable_absolute_bans",
      "label": "Absolute Bans (Impeccable)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": ".agents/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md",
      "source_location": "### Absolute bans",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Side-stripe borders, gradient text, glassmorphism as default, hero-metric template, identical card grids, modal as first thought. Match-and-refuse: if about to write these, rewrite with different structure."
    },
